sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as Customer
  participant UI as «boundary»<br/>SubmitReportPage
  participant B as «boundary»<br/>SubmitIssueReportBoundary
  participant C as «control»<br/>SubmitIssueReportController
  participant IssueReport as «entity»<br/>IssueReport
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  A->>UI: report a problem with an IDP, a designer or the platform
  UI->>B: POST /api/issue-reports (JWT)
  B->>C: submit(Integer reporterId, IssueReportRequest request)
  alt IDP_OR_DESIGNER without target
    C-->>B: ApiException
    B-->>UI: 400 error JSON
    UI-->>A: show error
  else valid
  C->>IssueReport: save()
  IssueReport->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>IssueReport: rows
  IssueReport-->>C: result
  C-->>B: IssueReportResponse
  B-->>UI: 201 Created JSON
  UI-->>A: show result
  end